{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-15T07:46:20.906Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"86e3bfd91bdfd1c20c4458ea","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-15T07:46:20.906Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Reproduced on unchanged Node 22.23.1: 10/12 passes and 2/12 failures with retained 33997332 and 33688722 bytes. The child already requests synchronous major GC, but V8 ArrayBufferSweeper::RequestSweep may still schedule backing-store reclamation on a worker. Node 22 source confirms --no-concurrent-array-buffer-sweeping instead runs DoSweep on the main thread and finalizes before returning: https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/v22.23.1/deps/v8/src/heap/array-buffer-sweeper.cc. Testing the one-flag child-only fix; retain the exact first-inventory boundary, 32 MiB corpus, 8 MiB assertion and 30-second timeout. Node 22, 24 and 26 recognize the flag."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-15T07:46:20.906Z"}],"before_hash":"078215e0fde2e9add1f566223929d40cbad656949b3a6c2f66b0554c45c729f0","after_hash":"bcbd9c3ba2f217c8e80e34f7dd56451120792bd482811cce66b186b7b3b0a3f6","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ef950a24df5ea8a86f146971fa19d99c4ad5620340918cbf64954b94c9186260"}
